Well, yes, and no. I want to make them much tougher for, say, pudding
farmers, by making it impossible to do them with the infinite fruits of
pudding farming.

I want to make the second stretch a bit harder, by making most monsters
slightly more than a speedbump.

Conversely I'd like to make the first stretch easier by reducing the
non-negotiability of certain resistances.
